Note on data and model artifacts:
The trained model artifacts in models/ were derived from the TDC Caco2_Wang
public benchmark dataset. Users must comply with the licensing terms of that
dataset when using or redistributing model artifacts.

The underlying molecular data (data/) come from the TDC Caco2_Wang benchmark,
published under the Therapeutics Data Commons license. Please review
https://tdcommons.ai for dataset-specific terms.

RDKit is used under the BSD license. See https://www.rdkit.org/
